meta {
  name: Approve
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/bills/{{billId}}/approve
  body: none
  auth: none
}

script:post-response {
  const body = res.getBody();
  if (res.getStatus() === 200 && body.payment) {
    bru.setVar('paymentId', body.payment.id);
  }
}

docs {
  Admin or Approver. Transitions PENDING_APPROVAL -> APPROVED, updates
  the Approval row, and creates the linked Payment in UNSCHEDULED with
  method = vendor.defaultPaymentMethod ?? 'ACH'. Switch to the
  local-approver env to confirm approvers can run it; viewer -> 403.

  Post-response stores `payment.id` in the `paymentId` var so the
  requests under payments/lifecycle/ can run immediately after.
}
